designer_notes = "HERBALISM TIER 1 (Luke, 2026-11-07, HERBALISM_HUNTING_PREP.md §7 step 1). Its round, PULL THE ROOT (H3, PROGRESS 51): A CLUMP (Luke, 2026-11-08): stem after stem for 15 s, FOUR whole for a full score (three until 2026-11-09). The trowel does the work too (Luke after his play, 2026-11-08: dig round, cut the snagging roots). LOOSE OR PACKED (Luke, 2026-11-09, \"cutaway, no chore\"): each side of a stem starts loose half the time (loose_pm 500), and ONE stroke digs a packed side (dig_pm 1000; packed soil holds the root to 40 %); the cutaway beside the stage shows which. Two side roots a stem, cut in the gold band or pulled through; a snapped stem worth a quarter of what came up. Tuning, mine (readout 100 / 94 / 88 / 69 %); the numbers are Luke's after his play. Back to the chore: loose_pm 0, dig_pm 500, target_plants 3. Needs a trowel of tier 1."
